OL,3,GNEWSAMarket Hall stint left me broken,
OL,4,Asays ex-trader
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former trader at Derby Market Hall
OL,7,Fhas said the venue's management should
OL,8,Fdo more to help businesses after she
OL,9,Fwas forced to close her stall due to a
OL,10,Flack of customers.
OL,12,FShereen Spurgeon, who ran a Caribbean
OL,13,Ffood stall at the city-centre market
OL,14,Funtil earlier this year, said business
OL,15,Finitially appeared promising but
OL,16,Fclaimed footfall was insufficient to
OL,17,Fsupport traders.
OL,19,F"It has broken me... my savings that I
OL,20,Fhad, that's gone. All it left me with
OL,21,Fis worry and a bit of depression," she
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
