OL,3,GNEWSAMarket Hall stint left me broken,
OL,4,Asays ex-trader
OL,5,
OL,6,FDerby City Council said they are
OL,7,Fconfident their current measures to
OL,8,Fattract new traders will "help
OL,9,Fstrengthen the Market Hall".
